      "message": "As I mentioned in b/309730110,\n\n`include $(BUILD_PHONY_PACKAGE)` has no practical effect; it cannot even correctly add dependencies to the phony target.\n\n`LOCAL_REQUIRED_MODULES` should not be directly used as a dependency for phony targets, and in many cases, it may not function properly.\n\nMoreover, setting `Add_deps_only \u003d True` already indicates that the phony target is intended to only increase its dependencies. The correct behavior is to define the phony target and its dependencies as follows:\n```\n.PHONY: \u003cphony_target\u003e\n\u003cphony_target\u003e : \u003cdeps...\u003e\n```",
